  "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en-AU\" id=\"top\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, shrink-to-fit=no\">\n    <script defer data-domain=\"florabase.dbca.wa.gov.au\" src=\"https://plausible.io/js/script.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Cabin:400,400i,500,500i,600,600i,700,700i|Open+Sans:300,300i,400,400i,600,600i&amp;subset=latin-ext\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <title>Taxon Profile of Scaevola pulvinaris (E.Pritz.) K.Krause | Florabase</title>\n    <link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"180x180\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\">\n    <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"32x32\" href=\"/favicon-32x32.png\">\n    <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"16x16\" href=\"/favicon-16x16.png\">\n    <link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" sizes=\"any\">\n    <link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/site.webmanifest\">\n    <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://florabase.dbca.wa.gov.au/browse/profile/7638\">\n        <meta name=\"google-site-verification\" content=\"W6mzmAPZvi_ya4nr9S-zjp4hBYqUXFFNP1QcLuKwX4g\">\n    <link rel=\"alternate\" type=\"application/rss+xml\" href=\"/nuytsia/news\" title=\"Nuytsia Publication Alert\">\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/css/custom.css\">\n    <script src=\"https://kit.fontawesome.com/fa33a2dbc8.js\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.css\"\n          integrity=\"sha256-p4NxAoJBhIIN+hmNHrzRCf9tD/miZyoHS5obTRR9BMY=\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"\n          href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/leaflet-fullscreen@1.0.2/dist/leaflet.fullscreen.css\"\n          integrity=\"sha256-YTbhDGEH5amI/JfotPMN7IByFpsN9e4tCBnv5oNdvHU=\">\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"\n          href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/leaflet-gesture-handling@1.2.2/dist/leaflet-gesture-handling.min.css\"\n          integrity=\"sha256-LhJiGL8zdnwmqQgxK45GXouxZnYhMrDdor4wyLxKxSg=\">\n    <meta name=\"dcterms.available\" content=\"910742400\">\n    <meta name=\"dcterms.coverage\" content=\"State of Western Australia\">\n    <meta name=\"dcterms.creator\" content=\"Western Australian Herbarium, Biodiversity and Conservation Science, Department of Biodiversity, Conservation and Attractions\">\n    <meta name=\"dcterms.format\" content=\"text/html\">\n    <meta name=\"dcterms.language\" content=\"en\">\n    <meta name=\"dcterms.publisher\" content=\"Western Australian Herbarium, Biodiversity and Conservation Science, Department of Biodiversity, Conservation and Attractions\">\n    <meta name=\"dcterms.rights\" content=\"© State of Western Australia 1998–\">\n    <meta name=\"dcterms.subject\" content=\"Archives; Australia; Botany\">\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Provides authoritative information on the flora of Western Australia\">\n    <meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"Western Australia, Eucalyptus, Acacia, Banksia, Grevillea, herbarium, PERTH, systematics, taxonomy, plant science, research, search, query, plant, plant kingdom, flora, database, information, conservation, phylum, family, genus, species, subspecies, variety, bioregion, interactive key, map, picture, image\">\n    <meta name=\"schema.dcterms\" content=\"https://purl.org/dc/terms/\">\n    <meta name=\"dcterms.identifier\" content=\"https://florabase.dbca.wa.gov.au\">\n    <meta name=\"dcterms.title\" content=\"Florabase—the Western Australian flora\">\n    <base target=\"_top\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<a class=\"visually-hidden-focusable\" href=\"#main-content\">Skip to main content</a>\n    <div class=\"alert alert-warning alert-fb alert-block\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <div class=\"row\">\n                <div class=\"col\">\n                    <i class=\"fa-duotone fa-square-exclamation fa-fw fa-2x\"></i>\n                    <div class=\"alert-fb-content\">\n                            <h3 class=\"alert-heading\">Service Notice</h3>\n                            <p>The Western Australian Herbarium’s collections management system, WAHerb, and DBCA’s flora taxonomic names application, WACensus, have been set to read-only mode since 1 October 2025. Recent taxonomic changes are not currently being reflected in Florabase, herbarium collections, or the census. The Herbarium team, working with the Biodiversity Information Office, now have the Nomos-hosted WACensus in production, and we will begin to update the flora and fungi for WA within the system soon. The Specify project team continues to test and streamline the new collections management system, and we expect this to be online in October. Please reach out to us if you have any questions or concerns.</p>\n                            <p class=\"small\">The notice period\n                                started at 9:45 am on Friday, 12 December 2025 +08:00 and will end at 12:00 pm on Thursday, 1 October 2026 +08:00.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n<nav class=\"navbar fixed-top navbar-expand-md navbar-fb bg-fb mb-0 d-print-none\" aria-label=\"Florabase menu\">\n    <div class=\"container\" role=\"menubar\">\n            <a href=\"/\" class=\"navbar-brand\" aria-label=\"Return to the Florabase home page\"\n               title=\"Return to the Florabase home page\">\n                Florabase\n            </a>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"navbar-toggler collapsed\"\n                data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#menubar\"\n                aria-expanded=\"false\">\n            <span class=\"visually-hidden\">Toggle navigation</span> <i\n            class=\"fa-solid fa-bars\"></i>\n        </button>\n        <div class=\"collapse navbar-collapse\" id=\"menubar\" role=\"menu\">\n            <ul class=\"navbar-nav me-auto\" role=\"group\">\n                <li class=\"nav-item dropdown\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"nav-link dropdown-toggle active\"\n                       data-bs-toggle=\"dropdown\" role=\"button\" aria-haspopup=\"true\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Find</a>\n                    <div class=\"dropdown-menu\" role=\"menu\">\n                        <a class=\"dropdown-item\"\n                           href=\"/browse/family\" role=\"menuitem\">Browse the WA Flora</a> <a\n                        class=\"dropdown-item\"\n                        href=\"/keys/\" role=\"menuitem\">Browse Interactive Keys</a>\n                        <div class=\"dropdown-divider\" role=\"separator\"></div>\n                        <a class=\"dropdown-item\"\n                           href=\"/search/advanced\" role=\"menuitem\">Search the WA Flora</a> <a\n                        class=\"dropdown-item\"\n                        href=\"/nuytsia/search\" role=\"menuitem\">Search <em>Nuytsia</em></a> <a\n                        class=\"dropdown-item\"\n                        href=\"/search/specimen/\" role=\"menuitem\">Search the Herbarium Specimens</a>\n                    </div>\n                </li>\n                <li class=\"nav-item dropdown\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"nav-link dropdown-toggle\"\n                       data-bs-toggle=\"dropdown\"\n                       role=\"button\" aria-haspopup=\"true\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><em>Nuytsia</em></a>\n                    <div class=\"dropdown-menu\">\n                        <a class=\"dropdown-item\"\n                           href=\"/nuytsia/\" role=\"menuitem\">Home</a>\n                        <a class=\"dropdown-item\"\n                           href=\"/nuytsia/current\" role=\"menuitem\">Current Issue</a>\n                        <a class=\"dropdown-item\"\n                           href=\"/nuytsia/issues\" role=\"menuitem\">All Issues</a>\n                        <a class=\"dropdown-item\"\n                           href=\"/nuytsia/search\" role=\"menuitem\">Search <em>Nuytsia</em></a>\n                        <a class=\"dropdown-item\"\n                           href=\"/nuytsia/authors\" role=\"menuitem\">For Authors</a>\n                        <a class=\"dropdown-item\"\n                           href=\"/nuytsia/resources\" role=\"menuitem\">Other Resources</a>\n                        <a class=\"dropdown-item\"\n                           href=\"/nuytsia/contact\" role=\"menuitem\">Contact <em>Nuytsia</em></a>\n                    </div>\n                </li>\n                <li class=\"nav-item dropdown\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"nav-link dropdown-toggle\"\n                       data-bs-toggle=\"dropdown\"\n                       role=\"button\" aria-haspopup=\"true\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Our Flora</a>\n                    <div class=\"dropdown-menu\">\n                        <a class=\"dropdown-item\"\n                           href=\"/in-focus\" role=\"menuitem\">In Focus</a> <a\n                        class=\"dropdown-item\"\n                        href=\"/statistics/\" role=\"menuitem\">Flora Statistics</a> <a\n                        class=\"dropdown-item\"\n                        href=\"/projects/\" role=\"menuitem\">Projects</a>\n                    </div>\n                </li>\n                <li class=\"nav-item\">\n                    <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/help/\" role=\"menuitem\">Help</a>\n                </li>\n            </ul>\n            <ul class=\"navbar-nav\">\n                    <li class=\"nav-item\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/signup\" role=\"menuitem\"> Sign\n                                                                                                              Up</a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"nav-item\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/signin\" role=\"menuitem\">\n                            <i class=\"fa-solid fa-right-to-bracket\"></i> Sign in</a>\n                    </li>\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</nav>\n<header>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div id=\"quick\" class=\"col\">\n                <div class=\"text-end\">\n                    <a href=\"/search/advanced\"\n                       class=\"link-light text-decoration-hover\"\n                       title=\"Search the WA Flora using the Advanced Search form\">Advanced Search</a>\n                </div>\n                <form id=\"qs\" action=\"/search/quick\" method=\"get\" role=\"search\">\n                    <div class=\"input-group\">\n                        <label for=\"q\" class=\"visually-hidden\">Search Names</label>\n                        <input type=\"search\"\n                               id=\"q\"\n                               name=\"q\"\n                               class=\"form-control\"\n                               placeholder=\"Search Names\"\n                               value=\"\"\n                               data-bs-toggle=\"popover\" data-bs-placement=\"bottom\"\n                               data-bs-trigger=\"hover focus\" data-bs-html=\"true\"\n                               data-bs-content=\"Search the WA flora using basic word querying. The wildcard characters <code>*</code> and <code>%</code> may be used. Advanced Search is available for more complex searches.\">\n                        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" type=\"submit\">Go</button>\n                        <a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"/help/searches\"\n                           title=\"Get help with searching Florabase\">\n                            <i class=\"fa-solid fa-square-question fa-lg\"></i></a>\n                    </div>\n                </form>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</header>\n    <div id=\"preamble-container\" class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col\">\n                    <nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><ol class=\"breadcrumb\"><li class=\"breadcrumb-item\">Plants</li><li class=\"breadcrumb-item\"><span>Magnoliophyta</span></li><li class=\"breadcrumb-item\"><span>Magnoliopsida</span></li><li class=\"breadcrumb-item\"><span>Asterales</span></li><li class=\"breadcrumb-item\"><a href=\"/browse/profile/22922\"><strong>Goodeniaceae</strong> R.Br.</a></li><li class=\"breadcrumb-item\"><a href=\"/browse/profile/22147\"><strong><i>Scaevola</i></strong> L.</a></li><li class=\"breadcrumb-item active\"><span><i>Scaevola</i> <i>pulvinaris</i> (E.Pritz.) K.Krause</span></li></ol></nav>\n                    <h1 class=\"display-4 mt-0\">\n                            <i>Scaevola</i> <i>pulvinaris</i> (E.Pritz.) K.Krause\n                            <br><small>Cushion Fanflower</small>\n                    </h1>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n<div id=\"main-container\" class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"row\">\n        <main id=\"main-content\" class=\"col\">\n                        <div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-lg-6 col-xl-5\">\n                        <dl class=\"row\">\n                                <dt class=\"col-sm-6 col-xl-5\">\n                                    Reference\n                                </dt>\n                                <dd class=\"col-sm-6 col-xl-7 mb-1\">\n                                    Engl., \n                                    Pflanzenr. 277(Heft 54):164 (1912)\n                                </dd>\n                                <dt class=\"col-sm-6 col-xl-5\">\n                                    Conservation Code\n                                </dt>\n                                <dd class=\"col-sm-6 col-xl-7 mb-1\">\n                                    <a href=\"/help/conservation-codes\"\n                                       title=\"Find out more about our conservation codes\">Not threatened</a>\n                                        </dd>\n                                <dt class=\"col-sm-6 col-xl-5\">\n                                    Naturalised Status\n                                </dt>\n                                <dd class=\"col-sm-6 col-xl-7 mb-1\">\n                                        Native to Western Australia\n                                        </dd>\n                                    <dt class=\"col-sm-6 col-xl-5\">\n                                Name Status\n                            </dt>\n                            <dd class=\"col-sm-6 col-xl-7 mb-1\">\n                                <a href=\"/search/current/7638\">\n                                    Current</a>\n                            </dd>\n                        </dl>\n                    </div>\n                        <div class=\"col-lg-6 col-xl-7\">\n                            <div class=\"text-block brief mt-lg-0\">\n                                <p> Prostrate shrub, 0.03-0.15 m high. Fl. blue-white, Aug to Nov. Sandy soils, clay loam. Damp situations.</p>\n                                    <footer>Grazyna Paczkowska, Descriptive Catalogue, 21 March 1996</footer>\n                                    </div>\n                        </div>\n                        </div>\n                <div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col\">\n                        <div id=\"distribution-map\" class=\"mt-3 mt-md-0 mb-3\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"text-block\">\n                            <h2>Scientific Description</h2>\n                                <p>Stems unribbed. Leaves flat, 10-35 mm long, 0.8-1 mm wide, Indumentum absent (leaves glabrous); margins entire. Bracteoles present, 5-7 mm long, hairy, with simple hairs. Pedicel absent (flowers sessile). Calyx lobes present, Calyx length 1-2 mm long, glabrous. Corolla blue, 10-11 mm long, without auricles, not spurred, glabrous on the outside, with sparse, simple hairs, hairy on the inside; central lobes 2.5-3 mm long, with wings; outer lobes 2.5-3 mm long, wings present on both sides, 0.2-1 mm wide. Anthers free. Ovary inferior, not gibbose; style 8-9 mm long, glabrous; indusium single, glabrous; ovules one or two. Flowers in August, September, October and November. Occurs in the Avon Wheatbelt (AW), Jarrah Forest (JF), Mallee (MAL) and Esperance Plains (ESP) IBRA Region(s), of the South West (SW) Botanical Province.</p>\n                                <footer>C. Hollister and K.R. Thiele, 2 August 2023</footer>\n                                </div>\n                    <div id=\"distribution\">\n                        <h2>Distribution</h2>\n                        <dl class=\"row\">\n                                <dt class=\"col-sm-4 col-md-3 col-xl-2\">IBRA Regions</dt>\n                                <dd class=\"col-sm-8 col-md-9 col-xl-10 mb-1\">\n                                    Avon Wheatbelt, Esperance Plains, Jarrah Forest, Mallee.\n                                </dd>\n                                <dt class=\"col-sm-4 col-md-3 col-xl-2\">IBRA Subregions</dt>\n                                <dd class=\"col-sm-8 col-md-9 col-xl-10 mb-1\">\n                                    Fitzgerald, Katanning, Recherche, Southern Jarrah Forest, Western Mallee.\n                                </dd>\n                                <dt class=\"col-sm-4 col-md-3 col-xl-2\">Local Government Areas (LGAs)</dt>\n                                <dd class=\"col-sm-8 col-md-9 col-xl-10\">\n                                    Cranbrook, Gnowangerup, Jerramungup, Katanning, Kent, Kojonup, Lake Grace, Plantagenet, Ravensthorpe, Wagin, West Arthur.\n                                </dd>\n                                </dl>\n                    </div>\n                </main>\n\n\n    </div>\n</div>\n<footer class=\"mt-5\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-lg-7\">\n                <ul class=\"list-inline mt-3 mt-md-0 d-print-none\">\n                    <li class=\"list-inline-item\">\n                        <a href=\"/help/\">About</a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"list-inline-item\">\n                        <a href=\"/help/contact\">Contact</a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"list-inline-item\">\n                        <a href=\"/help/copyright\">Copyright and Conditions of Access</a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"list-inline-item\">\n                        <a href=\"/help/privacy\">Privacy</a>\n                    </li>\n                </ul>\n                <p>Florabase is produced by the staff of the <a\n                        href=\"https://www.dbca.wa.gov.au/science/research-tools-and-repositories/western-australian-herbarium\">\n                    Western Australian Herbarium</a>, Biodiversity and Conservation\n                    Science, Department of Biodiversity, Conservation and Attractions.\n                    Publication or other use of content on this site is unauthorised\n                   unless that use conforms with the <a href=\"/help/copyright\">copyright statement</a>.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-lg-5\">\n                <h5 class=\"mt-3 mb-3 mt-md-0 d-print-none\">Cite Florabase</h5>\n                <p>Western Australian Herbarium (1998–). Florabase—the Western Australian flora. Department of Biodiversity, Conservation and Attractions. <a href=\"https://florabase.dbca.wa.gov.au/\" class=\"text-nowrap\">https://florabase.dbca.wa.gov.au/</a><br>(Accessed 15 September 2026).\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row d-print-none\">\n            <div class=\"col\">\n                <img src=\"/images/logo-dbca-white.png\" class=\"logo-dbca d-block d-md-inline-block mt-md-0 mb-0 mb-md-0 me-3\"\n                     title=\"Florabase is a Department of Biodiversity, Conservation and Attractions site\"\n                     alt=\"DBCA logo\">\n                <img src=\"/images/logo-bcs-white.png\" class=\"logo-bcs d-block d-md-inline-block mb-3\"\n                     title=\"Florabase is a Department of Biodiversity, Conservation and Attractions Biodiversity and Conservation Science site\"\n                     alt=\"DBCA Biodiversity and Conservation Science logo\">\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</footer>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/jquery@3.7.1/dist/jquery.min.js\"\n            integrity=\"sha256-/JqT3SQfawRcv/BIHPThkBvs0OEvtFFmqPF/lYI/Cxo=\"\n            crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.8/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js\"\n        integrity=\"sha384-FKyoEForCGlyvwx9Hj09JcYn3nv7wiPVlz7YYwJrWVcXK/BmnVDxM+D2scQbITxI\"\n        crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/underscore@1.13.6/underscore-min.js\"\n        integrity=\"sha256-JfQ26TMkbyea3ElnclpNkV4Px6ZBnTuVapRbtXgtxuU=\"\n        crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.js\"\n        integrity=\"sha256-20nQCchB9co0qIjJZRGuk2/Z9VM+kNiyxNV1lvTlZBo=\"\n        crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/leaflet-ajax@2.1.0/dist/leaflet.ajax.min.js\"\n        integrity=\"sha256-rVeyUZMfAHhQJ7hvWaHrKknTDdqGcn1gxBBJA++E4z8=\"\n        crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/heatmap.js@2.0.5/build/heatmap.min.js\"\n        integrity=\"sha256-/cgEs1fzqZ9ae4zMd9yq8JuWlM/s/Gvlob7j3YVXWgY=\"\n        crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/heatmap.js@2.0.5/plugins/leaflet-heatmap/leaflet-heatmap.js\"\n        integrity=\"sha256-8uGkuaHZ33DM5LlG5UikMP+Zs7/I7ryxVB0kFJObapg=\"\n        crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/leaflet-fullscreen@1.0.2/dist/Leaflet.fullscreen.min.js\"\n        integrity=\"sha256-RQN1bmEq/28pzVG8Csu34O677VNj5/1xl1wUGyDjMuo=\"\n        crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/leaflet-gesture-handling@1.2.2/dist/leaflet-gesture-handling.min.js\"\n        integrity=\"sha256-Z27Vo2NYi3eklYwgKkhgysoiRMJNOaBP+o4eF586vZ8=\"\n        crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/holderjs@2.9.9/holder.min.js\"\n        integrity=\"sha256-nQwLrn6KDmjRvP9frt70dSS7R2ubtjzxRry3Y+K3zKc=\"\n        crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script>\n<script>\n    $(document).ready(function () {\n        $('[data-bs-toggle=\"popover\"]').popover();\n        Holder.run();\n        const actives = ['find','browse-profile',];\n        $('[data-active]').each(function () {\n            menuActive = $(this).attr('data-active');\n            for (const active of actives) {\n                if (menuActive === active) {\n                    $(this).addClass('active');\n                    $(this).attr('aria-current', 'page');\n                }\n            }\n        });\n    });\n</script>\n\n                <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n                    var map = L.map(\"distribution-map\", {\n                        zoomSnap: 0.1,\n                        fullscreenControl: true,\n                        gestureHandling: true\n                    }).setView([-26.0, 133.0], 3);\n                    map.attributionControl.setPrefix('<a href=\"https://leafletjs.com/\">Leaflet</a>');\n                    var attribution = 'Map data © <a href=\"https://openstreetmap.org\">OpenStreetMap</a> contributors';\n                    L.control.scale({metric: true, imperial: false}).addTo(map);\n                    let base = L.tileLayer(\"https://{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png\", {\n                            minZoom: 2,\n                            maxZoom: 9,\n                            attribution: attribution\n                        }\n                    );\n                    map.addLayer(base);\n    \n                    function style(feature) {\n                        return {\n                            fillColor: 'transparent',\n                            weight: 1,\n                            opacity: 0.3333,\n                            color: '#6c757d',\n                            dashArray: '5,1,3'\n                        };\n                    }\n    \n                    let ibra = new L.GeoJSON.AJAX(\"/ws/map/features/IBRA\", {\n                        style: style\n                    });\n                    map.addLayer(ibra);\n                    let imcra = new L.GeoJSON.AJAX(\"/ws/map/features/IMCRA\", {\n                        style: style\n                    });\n                    map.addLayer(imcra, true);\n                    let url = \"/ws/map/polygons/7638\";\n                        let geom = new L.GeoJSON.AJAX(url, {\n                            onEachFeature: function (feature, layer) {\n                                layer.bindPopup('<a href=\"/search/specimen/?sheetno=' +\n                                                feature.properties.id +\n                                                '&type=all\">PERTH ' +\n                                                feature.properties.id +\n                                                '</a>');\n                                layer.setZIndexOffset(1000);\n                            }\n                        });\n                        geom.on('data:loaded', function () {\n                            map.fitBounds(geom.getBounds(), {padding: [50, 50]});\n                        });\n                        map.addLayer(geom);\n                </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
}
